# Typed errors

## Per module

`defineErrorCatalog` in `domain/errors.ts` with `code`, `httpStatus`, `exposeToClient`, `severity`.

```ts
throw USER_ERRORS.create("NOT_FOUND", { meta: { id } });
```

## HTTP / Actions

- Route Handlers: `errorResponse(error, context)` — logs + `toClientError` + status.
- Never send stack traces or internal messages when `exposeToClient: false`.
- Unexpected errors: client gets `digest` or empty payload; server logs via `logError`.

## Docs

Run `npm run errors:doc` after adding catalog entries. Read `src/common/errors/README.md`.
